Description: D-STAR gateway with DPlus, DExtra, DCS, G2, ircDDB and APRS support
 DStarGateway is a wxWidgets free port of ircddbGateway. It gives a D-STAR
 repeater or hotspot access to the DPlus, DExtra, DCS and G2 reflector
 networks, keeps the call sign routing information in the ircDDB network up
 to date and can exchange position and text messages with the APRS-IS
 network.
 .
 This package contains the gateway daemon, the D-RATS remote control, the
 time server and the text/voice transmit helpers, the systemd units, example
 configuration files in /etc/dstargateway and the host/voice data files in
 /usr/share/dstargateway. The reflector host files are downloaded at build
 time and refreshed daily by dstargateway-hostfiles.timer, which replaces the
 manual "make newhostfiles" step.
